{"id":18182,"name":"Lehigh County","slug":"lehigh-county","state":"Pennsylvania","code":"PA","program":null,"sourceUrl":"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/tax-deed/tax-deed-states/pennsylvania-tax-deeds/lehigh-county/","lastUpdated":"2026-07-20T14:52:45","facts":{"bidProcedure":"Competitive Bidding","extra":[{"label":"Typical Date","value":"September"},{"label":"Sale Contact","value":"Lehigh County Tax Claim Bureau"},{"label":"Auction Site","value":"Cedar Crest College, Alumnae Hall, Allentown, PA"},{"label":"Registration Required","value":"Yes"},{"label":"Payment Type","value":"Cashier’s Check, Certified Check, Money Order"}]},"bodyHtml":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed aligncenter is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"lEBZVhlDdgrUbWRpu4okP1K9JU3L0JWbhHmzx2P4IfExQy80Nv5cXjapB5zigTrVtX2Msk\"><iframe title=\"Jump on Big Savings Property Deals - Lehigh County - Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale\" width=\"1170\" height=\"658\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z-uIStv-lzo?feature=oembed\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Get Dustin Hahn’s Tax Lien and Deed FREE Mini-Course</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Jump on Big Savings Property Deals &#8211; Lehigh County &#8211; Pennsylvania Tax Deed Sale</h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Discover properties at 40-90% below market value in Lehigh County, Pennsylvania&#8217;s annual tax sales. This guide will help you navigate the Upset and Judicial sales, providing you with essential details and tips.</p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Tax Sales in Lehigh County</h3>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Upset Sale (September):</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Properties:</strong> Properties with two years of delinquent taxes</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Details:</strong> Properties come with existing liens and are sold as-is. Thorough research is recommended.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZDz8wp6qVUjutXgu9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cedar Crest College, Alumnae Hall, 100 College Drive, Allentown, PA 18104</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment:</strong> Full payment is required immediately after the sale by cashier&#8217;s check, certified check, or money order.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Judicial Sale (December):</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Properties:</strong> Unsold properties from the Upset Sale</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Details:</strong> Properties sold free and clear of all liens except federal ones.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Location:</strong> <a href=\"https://maps.app.goo.gl/ZDz8wp6qVUjutXgu9\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-color\">Cedar Crest College, Alumnae Hall, 100 College Drive, Allentown, PA 18104</mark></a></li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Payment:</strong> Full payment is required immediately after the sale by cashier&#8217;s check, certified check, or money order</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Private Sale and Repository:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Details:</strong> Unsold properties from Judicial Sales enter a Private Sale and eventually may land in the Repository List, available for bidding under specific conditions.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Repository Bids:</strong> Minimum bid of $500, subject to approval by local taxing authorities.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"Important-Information\">Important Information</h4>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"></figure>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania.webp 1081w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-541x360.webp 541w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-296x197.webp 296w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-768x512.webp 768w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-20x13.webp 20w,https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-32x21.webp 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" type=\"image/webp\"><img src=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania.png\" height=\"720\" width=\"1081\" srcset=\"https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania.png 1081w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-541x360.png 541w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-296x197.png 296w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-768x512.png 768w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-20x13.png 20w, https://vault.taxlienschool.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Lehigh-County-Courthouse-Pennsylvania-32x21.png 32w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1081px) 100vw, 1081px\" class=\"wp-image-18229 sp-no-webp\" alt=\"Lehigh County Courthouse Pennsylvania\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"  > </picture></figure>\n</div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-16018d1d wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--1\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://linktr.ee/dustinhahnrealestateinvesting\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Click Here to Book a Call with Dustin Hahn</a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Frequently Asked Questions</h3>\n\n\n\n<ol start=\"1\" class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Where and when will you advertise the upset sale?</strong><br><br>Lehigh County advertises the sale date at least 30 days in advance in <em>The Lehigh Legal Register</em> and two general circulation newspapers.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Do you need to register to attend the sale?</strong><br><br>Yes, registration is mandatory.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What bidding process does the auction use?<br></strong><br>The highest bidder purchases the properties. The bid includes current and delinquent taxes, penalties, interest, and other fees.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>What types of payment does the auction require for purchase?</strong><br><br>Buyers must complete full payment by 4:00 PM on the day of the sale using cashier&#8217;s checks, certified checks, or money orders.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Will the sale be final?</strong><br><br>Yes, all sales are final, with no refunds. The former owner has a 30-day period to contest the sale.</li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Do I have a clear title to the property purchased?</strong><br